# Copy this file to .env and put it in the workspace root (in clone mode that is this repository root, already in .gitignore); shared by all projects.
# You can also skip the file and set the ELEVENLABS_API_KEY environment variable directly.
# Optional: fill this in if you have an ElevenLabs account, to generate narration, compose music from the storyboard, and create custom sound effects. You can make a video without it too (falling back to library music + plain captions).
ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=
